  description: "# THE LISTENER (V2.5.2) - DUAL-TRACK CONTROL\n## 1. CORE PURPOSE\nPrimary
    Ingress for all Media Intents.  \n* Tracks Activity Transitions (WATCH TV, PLEX).
    \n* Syncs with the 'Media Call' system for surgical control (Volume/Playback).\n##
    2. RECENT UPDATES\n* **Naming Alignment**: Standardized entity lookups to use
    `{area_id}` as the prefix.\n* **Bug Fix**: Added 'dict' type cast and existence
    check for 'codebook' to prevent\n  'None has no attribute items' error during
    startup or missing sensor states.\n\n* **Normalization**: Aligned with UCC 'media_call'
    naming conventions. \n* **Scope Fix**: Moved target_mask resolution to the primary
    variables block to ensure event_data is populated."
  triggers:
  - topic: media_matrix/+/set_activity
    id: ingress_mqtt
    trigger: mqtt
  - event_type: universal_controller_command
    event_data:
      action_type: activity_call
    id: ingress_event
    trigger: event
  actions:
  - alias: 1. Resolve Ingress Context
    variables:
      area_id: "{% if trigger.id == 'ingress_mqtt' %}\n  {{ trigger.topic.split('/')[1]
        }}\n{% else %}\n  {{ trigger.event.data.area_key }}\n{% endif %}\n"
      raw_label: "{% if trigger.id == 'ingress_mqtt' %}\n  {{ trigger.payload }}\n{%
        else %}\n  {{ trigger.event.data.action_value }}\n{% endif %}\n"
      selected_label: '{{ raw_label | upper | replace(''_'', '' '') }}'
      codebook_raw: '{{ state_attr(''sensor.'' ~ area_id ~ ''_media_matrix_codebook'',
        ''entries'') }}'
      codebook: '{{ codebook_raw if codebook_raw is not none else {} }}'
      current_label: '{{ states(''select.'' ~ area_id ~ ''_media_matrix_activity'')
        | default(''OFF'') | upper | replace(''_'', '' '') }}'
      target_mask: "{% set ns = namespace(found=none) %} {% if selected_label == 'OFF'
        %}\n  0\n{% elif codebook is mapping %}\n  {% for mask, data in codebook.items()
        %}\n    {% if data.label | upper | replace('_', ' ') == selected_label %}\n
        \     {% set ns.found = mask %}\n    {% endif %}\n  {% endfor %}\n  {{ ns.found
        }}\n{% else %}\n  none\n{% endif %}\n"
  - event: media_matrix_execute
    event_data:
      area_id: '{{ area_id }}'
      target_mask: '{{ target_mask | int }}'
      app_name: "{% if target_mask | string in codebook %}\n  {{ codebook[target_mask
        | string].metadata.app_name | default('none') }}\n{% else %}\n  none\n{% endif
        %}\n"
      app_id: "{% if target_mask | string in codebook %}\n  {{ codebook[target_mask
        | string].metadata.app_id | default('none') }}\n{% else %}\n  none\n{% endif
        %}\n"
      command: "{% if target_mask | string in codebook %}\n  {{ codebook[target_mask
        | string].metadata.target_command | default('none') }}\n{% else %}\n  none\n{%
        endif %}\n"
  - alias: 2. Redundancy Guard
    condition: template
    value_template: '{{ selected_label != current_label }}'
    enabled: true
  - alias: 3. Synchronize UI Mirror
    parallel:
    - action: mqtt.publish
      data:
        topic: media_matrix/{{ area_id }}/previous_activity
        payload: '{{ current_label }}'
        retain: true
    - action: mqtt.publish
      data:
        topic: media_matrix/{{ area_id }}/current_activity
        payload: '{{ selected_label }}'
        retain: true
  - alias: 4. Execute Intent
    if:
    - condition: template
      value_template: '{{ target_mask is not none and target_mask != ''none'' }}'
    then: []
    enabled: false
  mode: parallel
  max: 10
- id: '1774948268274'
  alias: 'Media Matrix: Area Decoder (v1.8)'
  description: "# THE DECODER (V1.8) - CELP ALIGNED\n## 1. ARCHITECTURAL PHILOSOPHY
    Acts as the \"Silicon Realizer\" for the 16-bit Target Mask. Instead of  linear
    macros, it performs a state-deterministic alignment of physical  hardware to the
    desired codebook entry.\n## 2. V3.0 STANDARD ALIGNMENT\n* **Bitwise Parity**:
    Directly maps to the V3.0 Truth Table (Bits 7-15).\n* **Registry-Aware**: Resolves
    `SRC_IDX` (Bits 12-14) using the discovered `avr_registry`.\n* **Art Mode Realizer**:
    Uses Bit 8 (256) to manage Samsung \"The Frame\" Art Mode \n  transitions via
    double-power-key injection."
  triggers:
  - event_type: media_matrix_execute
    trigger: event
  actions:
  - alias: 1. Resolve Hardware and Contextual Waveform
    variables:
      area_id: '{{ trigger.event.data.area_id }}'
      target_mask: '{{ trigger.event.data.target_mask | int(0) }}'
      target_app: '{{ trigger.event.data.app_id | default(''none'') }}'
      target_cmd: '{{ trigger.event.data.command | default(''none'') }}'
      avr_entity: '{{ label_entities(''media_role_avr'') | select(''in'', area_entities(area_id))
        | first }}

        '
      tv_entity: '{{ label_entities(''media_role_tv'') | select(''in'', area_entities(area_id))
        | first | default(''none'') }}

        '
      remote_entity: '{{ label_entities(''media_role_remote'') | select(''in'', area_entities(area_id))
        | first | default(''none'') }}

        '
      source_entity: '{{ label_entities(''media_role_source_atv'') | select(''in'',
        area_entities(area_id)) | first | default(''none'') }}

        '
      target_source_idx: '{{ ((target_mask | bitwise_and(28672)) / 4096) | int }}'
      target_art_mode: '{{ (target_mask | bitwise_and(256)) > 0 }}'
      current_art_mode: '{% set sensor_id = ''sensor.'' ~ area_id | replace(''-'',
        ''_'') ~ ''_media_frame_tv_matrix_mode'' %} {{ is_state(sensor_id, ''ART'')
        }}

        '
      avr_source_list: '{{ state_attr(avr_entity, ''source_list'') | default([]) }}'
      target_source_name: '{{ avr_source_list[target_source_idx] if target_source_idx
        < (avr_source_list | length) else ''none'' }}'
  - alias: 2. Surgical Alignment (XOR Logic)
    parallel:
    - alias: 'Power On AVR - BIT 15: AVR_PWR (32768)'
      if:
      - condition: template
        value_template: '{{ (target_mask | bitwise_and(32768)) > 0 and not is_state(avr_entity,
          ''on'') }}'
      then:
      - action: media_player.turn_on
        target:
          entity_id: '{{ avr_entity }}'
    - alias: AVR - SOURCE SELECTION (Bits 12-14 Reconstruction)
      if:
      - condition: template
        value_template: '{{ target_source_name != ''none'' and target_source_name
          != state_attr(avr_entity, ''source'') }}'
      then:
      - action: media_player.select_source
        target:
          entity_id: '{{ avr_entity }}'
        data:
          source: '{{ target_source_name }}'
    - alias: 'Power On TV - BIT 10: DISP_PWR (1024)'
      if:
      - condition: template
        value_template: '{{ (target_mask | bitwise_and(1024)) > 0 and not is_state(tv_entity,
          ''on'') }}'
      then:
      - action: media_player.turn_on
        target:
          entity_id: '{{ tv_entity }}'
    - alias: 'Turn On Source - BIT 11: SRC_PWR (2048)'
      if:
      - condition: template
        value_template: '{{ (target_mask | bitwise_and(2048)) > 0 and not is_state(source_entity,
          ''on'') }}'
      then:
      - action: media_player.turn_on
        target:
          entity_id: '{{ source_entity }}'
    - alias: 'Art Mode - BIT 8: ART_MODE REALIZER (SAMSUNG FRAME DOUBLE-TAP)'
      if:
      - condition: template
        value_template: '{{ target_art_mode != current_art_mode and remote_entity
          != ''none'' }}'
      then:
      - action: remote.send_command
        target:
          entity_id: '{{ remote_entity }}'
        data:
          command:
          - KEY_POWER
          - KEY_POWER
          delay_secs: 0.1
  - alias: 3. Residual Excitation (App/Cmd Metadata)
    parallel:
    - alias: APP ID ALIGNMENT
      if:
      - condition: template
        value_template: '{{ target_app != ''none'' and state_attr(source_entity, ''app_id'')
          != target_app }}'
      then:
      - action: media_player.select_source
        target:
          entity_id: '{{ source_entity }}'
        data:
          source: '{{ target_app }}'
    - alias: TARGET COMMAND INJECTION
      if:
      - condition: template
        value_template: '{{ target_cmd != ''none'' }}'
      then:
      - action: remote.send_command
        target:
          entity_id: '{{ remote_entity }}'
        data:
          command: '{{ target_cmd }}'
  - alias: 4. State Verification Log
    action: logbook.log
    data:
      name: Matrix Decoder
      message: 'V3.0 Alignment: Area [{{ area_id }}] synchronized to Mask [{{ target_mask
        }}].  Art Mode: {{ ''ENABLED'' if target_art_mode else ''DISABLED'' }}. Resolved
        Source: {{ target_source_name }}

        '
